+# SAP CAR / POSDTA Market Map
+
+This folder stores public-source research deliverables for SAP Customer Activity Repository (SAP CAR), POS Data Transfer & Audit (POSDTA), Demand Data Foundation (DDF), Unified Demand Forecast (UDF), and Omni-Channel Article Availability (OAA) market mapping.
+
+## Contents
+
+- `reports/` — Markdown handover and market-map reports.
+- `data/` — Excel workbooks for company and people maps.
+- `sources/` — Source/reference files used during verification.
+- `scripts/` — Workspace scripts used to generate Excel deliverables.
+
+## Evidence standard
+
+The reports use public, source-verified information only. User-supplied assertions were not promoted to verified status unless corroborated by public sources. Broad SAP experience is not treated as SAP CAR/POSDTA/DDF/UDF/OAA evidence unless a source explicitly ties the person or company to those technologies.
+
+## Key files
+
+- `reports/SAP_CAR_POSDTA_people_market_map_handover.md` — current handover report and verification status.
+- `data/South_Africa_SAP_CAR_POSDTA_people_market_map_v2.xlsx` — latest people market-map workbook.
+- `data/South_Africa_SAP_CAR_POSDTA_market_map_final.xlsx` — company market-map workbook.
